WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.305
1. Open the contract and scroll down to Documents.

2
00:00:02.305 --> 00:00:04.363
2. Choose the Kind, for example Draft or Signed copy.

3
00:00:04.363 --> 00:00:07.971
3. Click Add document and choose the file: PDF, Word, Excel, Outlook email, text or an image, up to 25 MB.

4
00:00:07.971 --> 00:00:13.677
4. To replace a document but keep the earlier one, click the new version button beside it. Every version stays in the history.
